    "definition": "Checks against the bytes the LLM client handed to urllib, not against the arguments a function was called with. Every side is number-folded first, so a telephone number spoken as words and written by the recognizer as digits still matches. The two headline counts answer different questions and must not be added together: `masked_but_leaked` is a value the masker replaced that left the device anyway, which is a boundary failure and must be zero; `missed_by_detector_and_in_payload` is a gold entity the privacy model never found, which is a recall miss and is why the audio benchmark exists. A pipeline can have a perfect boundary and an imperfect detector, and this run says which."
